        </geography>
        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The company works on a technically high level; heavy machines (excl. building machines) are operated electrically; air recirculated in closed loop to avoid dust emissions; ground water used for washing.\n\n# Included processes\nIncludes the processes: crushing, washing, and transportation by conveyor belt. One part of the total heating energy for "production" and "administration" is included. Equipment included in the infrastructure: 2 crushers, 2 sieves, and 2 small silos.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
